	abstract = {The neuromorphic vision sensors for near-sensor and in-sensor computing of visual information are implemented using optoelectronic synaptic circuits and single-device optoelectronic synapses, respectively.This review focuses on the recent progress, working mechanisms, and image pre-processing techniques about two types of neuromorphic vision sensors based on near-sensor and in-sensor vision computing methodologies.},
